      "contract": "graph-math-step/v2",
      "display_unit": "inner",
      "explanation": "$$\\begin{gathered}a=0\\\\g\\!\\left(x\\right)=2x+5\\\\\\text{斜率}\\ 2>0,\\ \\text{严格递增}\\Rightarrow a=0\\ \\text{舍去}\\end{gathered}$$\n\n$$\\begin{gathered}a>0:\\ \\text{开口向上，对称轴}\\ x=- \\frac{1}{a}\\\\\\text{严格递减的部分}:\\ x\\le - \\frac{1}{a}\\\\- \\frac{1}{a}\\ge -2\\Rightarrow a\\in \\left[\\frac{1}{2}, +\\infty\\right)\\end{gathered}$$\n\n$$\\begin{gathered}a<0:\\ \\text{开口向下，对称轴}\\ x=- \\frac{1}{a}\\\\\\text{严格递减的部分}:\\ x\\ge - \\frac{1}{a}\\\\\\left(-\\infty, -2\\right]\\not\\subseteq \\left\\{x\\mid x\\ge - \\frac{1}{a}\\right\\}\\Rightarrow a<0\\ \\text{舍去}\\end{gathered}$$\n\n$$\\begin{gathered}a=0:\\ \\text{舍去}\\\\a>0:\\ a\\in \\left[\\frac{1}{2}, +\\infty\\right)\\\\a<0:\\ \\text{舍去}\\\\\\text{各类合并}:\\ a\\in \\left[\\frac{1}{2}, +\\infty\\right)\\end{gathered}$$",
